# Living Story Sync — configuration
#
# Copy to .env and fill in what you need:   cp .env.example .env
# .env is gitignored. Real shell variables override anything set here.
#
# The app runs with NONE of these set, using your local Claude Code login.

# ── Model backend ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Set a key to use the Anthropic API instead of the local Claude Code login.
# This is faster (13-way parallel instead of 4) and much cheaper per run.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Force a backend instead of auto-detecting. "sdk" needs a key above.
# LSS_BACKEND=sdk

# Model used for every call. Default: claude-opus-5
# LSS_MODEL=claude-opus-5

# How many formats are generated in parallel.
# Default: 13 with an API key, 4 on the Claude Code CLI (it spawns a process each).
# LSS_CONCURRENCY=13

# ── Claude Code CLI (only used when no API key is set) ───────────────────
# The server finds the binary itself. Set this only if it reports it cannot.
# Do NOT use CLAUDE_CODE_EXECPATH — that exists only inside a Claude Code session.
# LSS_CLAUDE_PATH=/Users/you/.vscode/extensions/anthropic.claude-code-<ver>-<platform>/resources/native-binary/claude

# ── Server ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PORT=8787

# ── Alternative text providers ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Any key below switches the app to that provider automatically.
# Priority when several are set: anthropic > openai > gemini > local Claude Code.
# Note: the prompts and JSON contracts were tuned on Claude. Other providers run,
# but re-check format fidelity with `npm run verify` before demoing on one.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# OPENAI_ORG_ID=org-...
# GEMINI_API_KEY=...

# Force one instead of auto-detecting: anthropic | openai | gemini | claude-cli
# LSS_TEXT_PROVIDER=openai

# ── Image generation ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Generates an illustrative BACKDROP for the reel cover. The headline, kicker and
# figures are still drawn in code on top, so they stay exact.
# The infographic is never sent to an image model — its numbers must be correct.
# Auto-detected from the keys above. Force with: openai | gemini | none
# LSS_IMAGE_PROVIDER=openai
# LSS_IMAGE_MODEL=gpt-image-1
